   + 
   N7 -> ( N8+N9+N10+N11+N12+N13+N14 ) 
   + 
   N8 -> ( N9+N10+N11+N12+N13+N14 ) 
   + 
   N9 -> ( N10+N11+N12+N13+N14 ) 
   + 
   N10 -> ( N11+N12+N13+N14 ) 
   + 
   N11 -> ( N12+N13+N14 ) 
   + 
